summary: "During the COVID-19 pandemic, CMAX Foundation and Cmax System developed mobile unit concepts for hospitals under pressure: Cmax Med for triage and isolation, Cmax ZZZ for staff rest, and Cmax Lab for mobile testing."
context: In the spring of 2020 hospitals faced a sudden need for beds, isolation space and testing capacity. Public health guidance pointed to free-standing structures and mobile testing units as ways to reduce exposure inside hospitals.
