## A record, not a headline

This action is kept as institutional history. The COVID-19 response shaped the Cmax Med unit that the Foundation proposes today for hospitals under pressure.

The number of units deployed, the hospitals served and the partners in each location were not documented on the previous website. They are being confirmed and will be added to this record only when they can be backed with documents.
